[779.682727, "o", "seed 0: maxdiff=2.715e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7314.346\r\nseed 1: maxdiff=2.534e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7215.700\r\nseed 2: maxdiff=2.561e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7204.949\r\nseed 3: maxdiff=2.641e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7285.219\r\nseed 4: maxdiff=2.594e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7250.161\r\nseed 5: maxdiff=2.516e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7162.076\r\nseed 6: maxdiff=2.643e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7258.478\r\nseed 7: maxdiff=2.553e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7191.471\r\nseed 8: maxdiff=2.568e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7230.039\r\nseed 9: maxdiff=2.520e+00 worst_ratio_to_tol=7173.011\r\nworst ratio (must be < 1): 7314.34619140625\r\n2dot cfg (128, 128, 32, 8, 4): 3.456 ms\r\n2dot cfg (128, 128, 64, 8, 4): 3.720 ms\r\n2dot cfg (128, 128, 64, 8, 3): 3.272 ms\r\n2dot cfg (128, 256, 64, 8, 3): 14.510 ms\r\n2dot cfg (256, 128, 64, 8, 3): 11.800 ms\r\ncfg (128, 128, 128, 8, 3) failed: OutOfResources\r\n"]
